s://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-23T09:02:47Z","updated_at":"2025-07-23T09:02:47Z","body":"Tried it on iPad, and it seems to still have the same issue. Project manager starts, but editor is not loading. I see the same `Attempt of waiting to finish on a thread that was never started.` in the web console.\r\n\r\nAdditionally, iPad seems to be incapable of loading big Wasm binary (with ~600 MB debug build Safari either close connection in the middle of loading or crashes immediacy after loading), so it only works if it is stripped (about 85 MB).\r\n\r\nAlso, it seems to be refusing to work via HTTP completely (unless it's localhost) and only loads via HTTPS (wasn't it required only for some features, or am I missing something).","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3106625391/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3106638938","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108832#issuecomment-3106638938",